WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:07.650
As discussed, we've decided to
perform Operation: "Golden Apple".

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.320
Miss Bianca...

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.520
I want you to be in
charge of this operation.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:14.700
Thank you very much.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:19.530
As you know, the goal of this mission
is to capture the target alive...

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.660
so we can use it for
our research material.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.100
Yes.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.990
Did you get information
as to her whereabouts?

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.340
Yes, of course.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.670
I'll be waiting for
the good news.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:31.920
Yes!

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:58.200
Start decorating the summer night sky.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:04.290
Diamonds started twinkling in a galaxy.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:10.170
I threw myself in a time and wandered.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:16.510
The smile made me warm up after a hard journey.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:29.150
You pretended like you didn't know that.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:34.490
If it's an endless dream...

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:41.160
I'll fight to make it shine.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:53.170
I'll expect again and again to realize...

00:01:54.170 --> 00:02:01.260
I'm only looking at my precious future.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.360
Lately, work's been getting done
quite satisfactorily. Hasn't it?

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:04.890
Yes it has.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:07.520
Well, thank you for
all your hard work.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.080
You worked hard too.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.830
Actually, I have something
to tell everyone.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.250
Since we came a
long way to the south...

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:23.110
I made plans to stay one night at
a resort hotel on Veronica lsland...

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.260
to show my appreciation.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.220
Papa, is it true?!

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:30.560
Don't call me Papa.
Call me President!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.600
Can we afford it, President?

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:37.080
Sure, our company has been
doing better recently.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.960
I thought I should return
something to my employees.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.850
You're the best!

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.710
Are you sure?

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.170
Here they come.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.670
Oh, how gorgeous.

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.600
Well, it's all right.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.940
I made a reservation under
the name of K2 Corporation.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.050
Yes, sir.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.110
We reserved the rooms for you.

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:13.110
This is gorgeous.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.040
I could sure live here.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.630
Yahoo!

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:23.800
Wow!

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:32.720
Aika, let's go to the pool!
The pool!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.480
All right.
Can you wait a minute?

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.400
If I don't use a lot of this
l'll be very sorry later.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.650
Where's Papa?

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.170
He told me he had
to go somewhere.

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.690
I see. He is probably doing that.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:52.910
That?

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.250
I win!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.500
Oh, yeah!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:17.790
Why did you do that?

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.410
Oh, excuse me.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:38.730
I'm very sorry.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:40.560
Oh, no. Don't worry about it.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.320
Can you bring the same
drink for this lady?

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.600
Thank you very much.

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:58.560
No, l'm the one who
caused you trouble.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:03.570
You must have just arrived
at this hotel today.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.100
How can you tell?

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.610
Because there's no way I could've
overlooked such a beautiful woman.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.070
My, you're quite the charmer.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.280
May I have your name?
lf you don't mind...

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.660
My name is Pierre Valimore.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.750
I'm Aika.
Aika Sumeragi.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.150
Oh, what an exotic name!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.090
You must be related
to some noble family.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.670
Well, l'm not sure.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.430
Have you been staying
here long, Mr. Valimore?

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.510
Call me Pierre.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:38.980
Been here long, Pierre?

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:44.650
Yes, l'm here for vacation,
but I was getting bored recently.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:48.000
Then a beautiful woman
like you shows up.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.440
This certainly is good fortune.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.650
You really are a charmer.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.620
I can only tell the truth.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.400
Rion...

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:57.830
Huh?

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:04.330
Aika.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.500
They're going to do it, aren't they?

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:28.700
Why are we going through so much
trouble to capture one woman?

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:33.420
I wouldn't be satisfied by
just physically capturing her.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:35.990
I need to completely humiliate her.

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:45.710
What's wrong with you?
You're in a bad mood.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:50.410
Well... it seems Aika is a
rather imprudent person.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:53.880
Perhaps she's feeling liberated
here on the southern island.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:57.700
I mean running off with
such a cheap flashy guy.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.860
Maybe you should find
a nice guy too, Rion.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.900
Excuse me.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:18.620
Huh?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:23.410
I'm a little lost.
Which way is the elevator?

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.220
Go over there,
and make a left.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.770
Really?
We're also from Tokyo!

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:04.740
Well, we're going to the beach now.
Do you want to come with us?

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.330
OK.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.300
Let's go and let's do!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.260
All right! One more round.
Give me the chips.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:22.140
We captured two of the targets.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.700
We are also holding the last target.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.850
All right. We're about
to head back there.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:43.790
Did they go somewhere?

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:44.870
Is anything wrong?

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.680
Well, my companions aren't there.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:51.950
They might be in the restaurant.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:52.790
I guess so.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.410
No, l'm not.

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:11.450
I'm not usually such an
impulsive woman like this.

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:13.820
Something is wrong with me today.

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:16.170
Yes, yes, I understand.

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:21.660
I guess the southern ocean
has a strange effect on people.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.100
It does, doesn't it? It must.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.160
Excuse me for a moment.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:38.230
I feel really strange today.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.090
It can happen to anyone.

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.520
Pierre, you are really a gentleman.

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.560
You don't know about
my true nature.

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.270
Oh, here, it's here.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:06.870
This is not good, Pierre...
Having your way with a drunk woman.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.890
It's not like a gentleman.

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:18.760
Who are you people?

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.130
What is this all about?

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.720
This is the answer.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.060
That uniform...

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.480
Aika Sumeragi, l've been
waiting for this moment.

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:36.440
Pierre, get out of here!

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:44.350
I will share a secret
with you first.

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:50.950
A...woman!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.290
Everything has worked out
as we planned.

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.750
Why did you do this?

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:02.670
For revenge!

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:09.760
Look down there.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:15.940
Rion!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:20.180
First, you'll watch your
friends struggle in pain.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.190
They'll die! They'll die!

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.200
Well, if you want to save them...

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:33.450
What the—?!

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:46.650
I'm awake now.

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.570
The drug isn't working on her?!

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.940
Miss Bianca, the purpose
of this mission is...

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:23.880
I know!

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.570
She was a woman...

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.770
She was a woman...

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:36.390
I've already kissed her.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:39.290
Aika!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:41.490
They are all Hargen's people!

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.010
I know.

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:45.030
They're trying to get
revenge for him.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.640
What?! Revenge?!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.250
What is Hargen?

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.090
Well...

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:54.970
it would take a long
time to explain...

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.850
but let's just say,
they're the villains!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.220
Over there!

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.130
Yeah!

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.480
Oh, thank you.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.710
You're welcome.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.710
It seems like Hargen's people
are all over this hotel.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:45.880
What should we do, Akia?

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.590
We have to find the president first
and then get out of here.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:02.650
Was that guy also
working for them, Aika?

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.540
Oh, please don't bring that up.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:07.250
I knew it!

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:10.980
That guy wasn't a guy,
he's a girl.

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:12.210
What?!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.250
Go on ahead.

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:21.180
But...

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.360
Just do it.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:30.880
I was really fooled by you.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.090
You've never seen such a
gorgeous guy like me, have you?

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.050
Quite true!

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:43.440
Miss Valerie!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:44.680
Do it!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:16.090
I wouldn't be satisfied
just shooting you dead.

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.010
Is that so?

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.490
Damn it!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:54.010
This is Bianca. Request
a mobile unit air-strike!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:57.890
Roger!
We will rush to get over there.

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:12.900
What's that?

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.080
Then what's Aika doing?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.330
Well...

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.840
What the hell is this?!

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:34.020
It appears to be an armored car.

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:35.850
I can tell that by looking!

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:38.510
I mean why did it suddenly
appear out of nowhere!?

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.660
Aren't I your target?

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:58.240
Aika!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.580
Good! Move out!

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:11.250
Y...yes, Miss Bianca.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.010
Why did she have to take my job?

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.650
What is this water?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.310
We're drowning!

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:40.490
President!

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:42.050
Aika!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.000
You guys stay here.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:44.910
Papa!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.220
What's your plan?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:49.250
There's another one.
Get in quickly.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.440
We won't beat them this way!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.640
I've got an idea.

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:12.480
Aika!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.070
Stupid!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.130
We did it!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:52.060
That was an easy ending.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.970
Miss Bianca!

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:02.780
No!

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:24.610
Aika!

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.440
Well, this turned out
to be a terrible vacation.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:35.190
Indeed.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:41.120
I guess Hargen's people
could attack us at anytime.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.170
Indeed.

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.400
There's trouble ahead.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:47.230
What is this Hargen?

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:49.030
Well...

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:54.390
A guy, named Hargen, planned to rule
the earth using the power of Lagu.

00:21:54.390 --> 00:21:56.490
What's Lagu?

00:21:56.490 --> 00:21:59.670
Lagu?...well, that is...

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.010
The operation failed.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:09.640
I assume Aika and her companions
already escaped from the island.

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:11.860
I see.

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:16.940
As I thought, she wasn't
so easy to handle.

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:19.620
Let's take the next
action immediately.

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:20.270
Yes sir!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:24.240
Operation: "Silver Wild Grapevine''
is already prepared.

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:27.830
Excellent.

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:10.610
A big company hires the K2
Corporation for an investigation...

00:24:10.610 --> 00:24:12.800
so we head north.

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:19.050
Arriving at their installation we meet
a beautiful, young, ace fighter pilot.

00:24:19.440 --> 00:24:22.640
To test my compatibility
with the Probe-jet...

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:25.760
this girl requests that
I take a pre-flight exam.

00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:28.460
What does this girl
intend to do to Aika?

00:24:28.460 --> 00:24:30.850
She's definitely up to something!

00:24:30.850 --> 00:24:35.780
After thoroughly examining me,
the Delmos reveal themselves.

00:24:36.180 --> 00:24:38.440
While escaping with my data...

00:24:38.440 --> 00:24:41.640
the beautiful young Delmo girl
launches a cunning attack.

00:24:42.500 --> 00:24:44.740
Aika's next trial...

00:24:45.420 --> 00:24:47.560
Delmo Operation: "White Silver''
Delmo Operation:
"White Silver''

00:24:47.560 --> 00:24:48.010
Delmo Operation: "White Silver''

00:24:48.010 --> 00:24:51.000
The heat from this fierce battle
with the beautiful girl Delmo...

00:24:51.000 --> 00:24:52.970
could even melt snow.
Delmo Operation: "White Silver''

00:24:52.970 --> 00:25:00.080
Delmo Operation: "White Silver''
